# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# CURSOR IGNORE — Cursor Agent Context Window Protection
# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
#
# Purpose: Exclude non-essential paths from Cursor'"'"'s indexer so the agent'"'"'s
#          context window is reserved for production code, not for build
#          artifacts, one-off logs, or superseded asset directories.
#
# Generation date: 2026-07-30
# Generated by:    REPARK 6.0 — Project Sanitization Phase 1
# Companion doc:   CLEANUP_AUDIT.md
#
# Syntax reference: https://docs.cursor.com/context/ignore-files
# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────

# ══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════
# 1. Node / Next.js build artifacts (NEVER edit)
# ══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════
node_modules/
.next/
out/
build/
*.tsbuildinfo
next-env.d.ts

# ══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════
# 2. Logs — root-level & historical (kept for grep archaeology, not for IDE)
# ══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════
# Per-scan / per-deploy logs that have zero impact on agent reasoning.
*.log
dev.err.log
dev.log
tmp_tunnel.log

# Historical upload / e2e / tsc logs from 2026-07 — keep on disk but
# keep OUT of the agent'"'"'s indexer.
deploy.log
upload-*.log
e2e-*.log
tsc-*.log
_build.log
_dev.log
_dev2.log
build.log
build-prod.log
build_err.txt
build_err_log.txt
build_log.txt
build_out.txt
build_output.txt
build-report.txt
install.log
vitest.log
prod-server.log
prod-server-err.log

# ══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════
# 3. One-off scripts & temp tooling (kept on disk, not for indexing)
# ══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════
# Per the P1 backlog entry "清理 scripts/_*.cjs 与 temp-*.mjs" — these were
# ad-hoc probes from a single debug session; they should NOT eat context.
scripts/_*.cjs
scripts/_*.mjs
scripts/_*.js
temp-*.cjs
temp-*.py
temp-*.mjs

# ══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════
# 4. Superseded asset directory (H5 000/ → public/H501/ in production)
# ══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════
# `H5 000/` is the upstream Spine/Wwise source pack (~24MB, 84 files, last
# touched 2026-06). The production code path is `public/H501/` (deployed via
# `scripts/copy_voice_assets.mjs`). Grep proves zero import references.
# Kept on disk as authoritative source for re-syncs, but excluded from IDE.
H5 000/

# ══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════
# 5. Engineering docs (Cursor reads code, not prose)
# ══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════
# The agent needs ACTIVE_CONTEXT.md (Context Anchoring protocol) and the
# most recent AUDIT_MEIMO file. Everything else is archival — keep on disk
# but exclude from the indexer.
#
# NOTE: ACTIVE_CONTEXT.md is NOT excluded — REPARK 6.0 §2 requires the agent
#       to read it at the start of every session.
#
# Manual override (in case the agent DOES need a specific doc):
#   @docs/<filename>  → re-includes for the current session only.
docs/HANDOFF_2026-07-25.md
docs/ENGINEERING_CONTEXT.md
docs/AUDIT_MEIMO_2026-07-30.md
# (NEW docs/Audit files explicitly listed so future audits are also excluded.)

# Root-level md reports — historical scans / handoffs / customer docs.
# These are not part of the runtime codebase.
FULL_PROJECT_AUDIT_REPORT_2026-07-27.md
PROJECT_AUDIT_REPORT_BY_REQUIREMENT_SECTIONS.md
PROJECT_GENESIS_REPORT.md
PROJECT_SCAN_REPORT.md
PROJECT_STATE_REPORT.md
SHADOW_AUDIT_REPORT.md
MILESTONE_AUTO_CLAIM_IMPLEMENTATION_PLAN.md
AWS_RDS_MODULAR_INIT_PLAN.md
REPARK_EXECUTION_LOG.md
CLIENT_ACCEPTANCE_GUIDE.md
CUSTOMER_REPLY_SCRIPTS.md
CUSTOMER_TESTING_GUIDE.md
DEPLOYMENT_CHECKLIST.md
DEPLOY_AWS.md
DEPLOY_READINESS.md
DEV_SETUP.md
LOCAL_TESTING_CHECKLIST.md
OWNER_KEY_MANAGEMENT.md
README.md
TESTING_CHECKLIST.md
blueprint.md

# ══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════
# 6. Test artifact dump (binary junk from earlier debugging)
# ══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════
test-results/
verify_result.json
verify_result.png

# ══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════
# 7. Sensitive files (excluded but NEVER delete — covered by .gitignore too)
# ══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════
# P0 §4.3 ACTIVE_CONTEXT: cleanup of root-dir secrets is OWNED by Commander.
# Cursor simply must not index the contents.
admin-pw.txt
mercenary_h5_project.pem.archived
keys/
.env.production
.env.local
.env.*.local
